      "html": "<p>A very rarely offered dwarf cichlid from the Rio Tapajós in Brazil. Like the humphead cichlids of the genus Steatocranus in Africa, Teleocichla have a reduced swim bladder, so they live exclusively near the bottom. The specimens received have very nice orange colours in the fins.</p>"
